## Review Applicant Resumes

Six people applied for an open Software Engineering position at your company. **Choose two candidates to interview.**

Write down your selection and what qualities or information you prioritized. You may choose to use Page 2 of this lesson's <a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1KWiPmB-kVpuTPXPSq2xXnhdQfoMkgSYgaJRKFPeI_NA/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.aja5sw9sqnkf" target="blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Activity Guide</a> to record your answers.

